#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:751
msgid ""
"Navigating back up the folder tree using area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Gå uppåt i mappträdet med hjälp av område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:755
msgid ""
"If the sub-folder selected in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> does"
" not contain the branch of the folder tree leading to the desired folder, "
"the buttons in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> can be used to jump"
" further up the folder tree but only as far as the starting folder selected "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. Area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> provides a list of buttons with the names of all "
"the folders between the starting folder listed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> and the currently selected folder. By clicking on"
" one of these buttons, that is by placing the mouse pointer over the button "
"and clicking with the primary mouse button, the folder listed on the button "
"will be opened in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> so that the "
"selection process can restart from this branch."
msgstr ""
"Om undermappen du valt i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> inte "
"leder till mappen du söker kan du använda knapparna i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> för att gå uppåt i mappträdet. Du kan bara gå så "
"långt som till startmappen i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. "
"Område <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> visar en knapp för varje mapp "
"mellan startmappen i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> och den "
"valda mappen. Klicka på en knapp för att öppna den mappen i område <emphasis"
" role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> och fortsätta navigeringen därifrån."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:780
msgid "Select the file."
msgstr "Välj filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:783
msgid ""
"The file must be selected by placing the mouse pointer over the filename in "
"area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> and clicking with the primary "
"mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Markera filen genom att föra pekaren till filnamnet i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> och klicka med primär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:790
msgid ""
"The file can be opened and the dialog dismissed by selecting the file with a"
" double click of the primary mouse button. The last two steps are optional "
"and, if configured appropriately, the file can be selected and opened simply"
" by double clicking on the file name."
msgstr ""
"Du kan öppna filen och stänga dialogrutan genom att dubbelklicka på filen "
"med primär musknapp. De två sista stegen är valfria. Om dialogrutan är rätt "
"inställd räcker det att dubbelklicka på filnamnet för att välja och öppna "
"filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:802
msgid "Optional: Select the file format type."
msgstr "Valfritt: Välj filformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:805
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can automatically recognize the file "
"format type. Alternatively, the file format can be specified explicitly by "
"clicking on the drop down list button in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> and scrolling down the list to the desired file "
"type."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan identifiera filformatet automatiskt."
" Du kan också ange formatet själv genom att öppna rullgardinsmenyn i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> och bläddra till önskad filtyp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:827
msgid "Optional: Determine the file character encoding."
msgstr "Valfritt: Ange filens teckenkodning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:830
msgid ""
"For text files the character encoding must be specified. By default, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> takes the character encoding appropriate"
" to the user's locale. This encoding scheme can be changed by clicking on "
"the drop down menu button in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> and "
"navigating the menus to find the desired encoding."
msgstr ""
"För textfiler behöver du ange teckenkodningen. Som standard använder "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kodningen för användarens systemlokal. "
"Ändra kodningen genom att öppna rullgardinsmenyn i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> och välja önskad kodning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:842
msgid "Click the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> button."
msgstr "Klicka på knappen <guibutton>Öppna</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:845
msgid ""
"Finally, the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> button must be pressed by placing "
"the mouse pointer over the button and clicking with the primary mouse "
"button."
msgstr "Till sist klickar du på knappen <guibutton>Öppna</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:853
msgid ""
"The file will be opened in a new window. If the selected file format was "
"\"Text import (configurable)\" the <interface>Text Import</interface> druid "
"will be opened. This druid is explained in great detail in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-textImport\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Filen öppnas i ett nytt fönster. Om du valde filformatet ”Textimport "
"(konfigurerbar)” öppnas guiden <interface>Textimport</interface>. Den "
"beskrivs utförligt i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport\"/>."
